2026-01-31 21:56:59 | OUTPUT |     On SURPRISE & SETUP: Joke 1 subverts expectations more effectively. The headline sets up a serious sports event; the punchline reveals the hosts are focused on niche, non-football preparations. Joke 2’s premise (scrambling for accommodations) is a more predictable take on "hosting."
2026-01-31 21:56:59 | OUTPUT |     
